  "solution": "Hai mặt phẳng  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> lần lượt có véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tMặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> vuông góc với hai mặt phẳng: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên có một véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tMặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
